<title>CANADA: Petro-Canada lowers posted oil prices.</title>
<headline>Petro-Canada lowers posted oil prices.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Petro-Canada said it lowered the price it would pay for some grades of crude oil by C$2.00/cubic metre or C$0.32/barrel, effective immediately.</p>
<p>The new prices were listed as follows:</p>
<p>Edmonton light sweet C$195.00/cubic metre, or C$31.00/barrel</p>
<p>Cromer light sour C$189.00/cubic metre, or C$30.05/barrel</p>
<p>Hardisty medium C$156.00/cubic metre, or C$24.80/barrel</p>
<p>((Reuters Calgary Bureau (403) 531-1624))</p>
</text>
